        "de158e68-5d0d-4819-a625-e2dabdff87d1": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Does It Actually Work?",
            "heading_size": "medium",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "collapse_icon": "carret",
            "display_top_border": true,
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p>Our Pure Shilajit Gummies are backed by clinical research to enhance male performance — the natural boost men have been seeking for centuries.</p><p>Rich in <strong>1500mg Pure Himalayan Shilajit</strong>, <strong>Ashwagandha</strong>, <strong>Gokshura</strong>, and <strong>Black Musli</strong>, they increase blood flow, boost testosterone, and restore stamina naturally.</p><p>The gummy delivery system ensures <strong>optimal absorption</strong> and <strong>sustained benefits</strong> — harder erections, increased stamina, and restored drive in just weeks — without prescriptions, harsh chemicals, or synthetic hormones.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 9,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_ewadFh": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Frequently Asked Questions",
            "heading_size": "medium",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "collapse_icon": "carret",
            "display_top_border": true,
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p><strong>When can I expect results?</strong><br/>Most men notice increased morning erections and subtle energy boost within 2-3 weeks. For full performance benefits — harder erections, lasting stamina, restored libido — consistent daily use for 60-90 days delivers optimal results. This isn't a quick fix. It's a restoration of your body's natural function.</p><p><strong>Will this help with both energy and performance?</strong><br/>Yes. The 1500mg Shilajit supports cellular energy and testosterone production. Ashwagandha reduces cortisol (the stress hormone that kills your drive). Gokshura improves blood flow for firmer erections. Black Musli supports stamina and endurance. You get all-day energy AND bedroom performance in one formula.</p><p><strong>How many should I take and when?</strong><br/>Take 2 gummies daily — morning or evening. Consistency is key. The clinical doses compound over time, with most men seeing significant improvements between Week 4-8. For best results, commit to the full 90-day protocol.</p><p><strong>Is this safe to take daily, especially with other medications?</strong><br/>Our formula contains natural adaptogens and herbal extracts with no known side effects when taken as directed. However, if you're taking blood pressure medications, blood thinners, or have heart conditions, consult your doctor before use. Our gummies are stimulant-free and caffeine-free</p><p><strong>What makes this different from gas station pills or prescriptions? </strong></p><p>Our gummies contain <strong>1500mg Gold-Grade Himalayan Shilajit (78% Fulvic Acid)</strong>, <strong>Ashwagandha</strong>, <strong>Gokshura</strong>, and <strong>Black Musli</strong> — all triple lab-tested for purity. No mystery compounds. No synthetic chemicals. No dangerous stimulants.</p><p><strong>How long do the effects last?</strong><br/>Unlike quick-fix pills that wear off in hours, our formula builds your body's natural function over time. After 60-90 days of consistent use, the benefits become your new baseline — you won't need to \"take something\" before every encounter. Your body just works the way it should.</p><p><strong>Are there any side effects I should know about?</strong><br/>None reported when taken as directed. Some men experience a mild energy boost or improved mood in the first week — that's normal. Unlike prescriptions, there are no headaches, flushing, or vision changes. Our formula is gentle, natural, and designed for daily long-term use.</p><p></p>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 24,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        },
