            "collapse_icon": "carret",
            "display_top_border": true,
            "open": false,
            "content": "<h5>Enhanced Performance Or Full Refund</h5><p>Customer satisfaction is our #1 priority at Wellness Nest. If you don't experience harder erections, increased stamina, or improved performance within 90 days, we'll give you a full refund — no questions asked.</p><p>We only want you to keep them if they work.</p><h5>Fast, Discreet Shipping</h5><p>We ship from our US warehouse. Your gummies arrive in <strong>plain, unmarked packaging</strong> — nobody will know what's inside. Guaranteed delivery within 3-5 business days anywhere in the US, within 4-15 days business days anywhere outside US.</p><p>✓ Discreet packaging<br/>✓ No product details visible</p>",
